DECLARE Party IS ONE OF Borrower, Lender, Stranger
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF Pay HAS payer IS A Party, to IS A Party, amount IS A NUMBER

GIVEN creditor IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
f creditor MEANS
  PARTY Borrower
  MUST Pay Borrower (EXACTLY creditor) 10
  WITHIN 5
  HENCE FULFILLED
  LEST BREACH

-- right payee
#TRACE f Lender AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 10 AT 2

-- wrong payee
#TRACE f Lender AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Stranger 10 AT 2

-- wrong amount
#TRACE f Lender AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Borrower DOES Pay Borrower Lender 99 AT 2
